<lb n="20"/><gap reason="lost" extent="unknown" unit="line"/>
<lb n="20"/><supplied reason="lost">Ἴλιον εἰς ἱερήν. τῇ δ᾽ ἀντίος ὄρνυτ᾽</supplied> Ἀπ<supplied reason="lost">όλλων</supplied>
